window.products.push({"id":202050,"name":"SearchI Dining Room Chair Covers Set of 6, Stretch Parsons Chair Slipcovers Super Fit Spandex Removable Washable Kitchen Chair Protector Cover for Din","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jg1nV2a1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SearchI Stretch Dining Chair Covers Spandex Kitchen Chair Covers Removable Dining Chair Protector Slipcovers Are you worried about the worn-out chairs? SearchI universal slipcovers for dining chairs will be your best choice, will create a better household life for you. SearchI devotes to provide high quality dinning room chair slipcovers at reasonable prices and best service for customers. Why Choose Our Dining Chair Covers? 1. FASHION HOME DECOR--A great decor for your dining room with stretchy parsons chair covers,will transform your old dining chairs into brand new, bring warmness into your home. 2. QUALITY MATERIAL--Chair seat covers are made from a blend of polyester and spandex fabric with excellent elasticity, soft and long-lasting durability; Memory stretch fabric and all-around elastic to give a snug fit on the chair that goes on easily and stays in place. 3. EASY MAINTENANCE--SearchI elastic armless chair slipcovers will protect your chair from dirt, spills and abrasion. It can be safely washed in the washing machine when needed.  4. WIDE USAGE--SearchI dining chair slip cover is great for all seasons and any ocassions like dining room, hotel, kitchen, restaurant, party,wedding banquet, dinner, meeting, celebration, etc. 5. PERFECT GIFT-- An ideal purchase for Christmas, Mothers Day, Valentines Day, Birthday gifts for your friends and family.Whether its a holiday, a wedding party, or a special occasion, this dining chair cover can be a cost-effective gift. Suitable for Most Chairs: Back Height: 17.7-23.6inch (45-60cm) Seat Length:14-19.7inch (36-50cm) Seat Width:14-19.7inch (36-50cm) Please Note: 1.Kindly measure your chairs before ordering to ensure the best fit. 2.All pictures in-kind shooting, but maybe a little color diference due to differnent shootinglight and monitors. 3. Used on arm chairs and foldable chairs are NOT recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jg1nV2a1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SearchI","source_asin":"B0989MXM98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0989MXM98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0989MXM98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":202051,"name":"Non-stick Copper Frying Pan CeramiTech with Ceramic Coating with Induction cooking,Oven & Dishwasher safe 9.5 Inches By Tiabo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710t4U5crLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"START COOKING WITH THE BEST NON-STICK FRYING PAN FROM Tiabo! Professional chefs and kitchen novices alike agree that the quality of your cooking ware matters if you want to consistently turn out delicious meals! There are certain tools of the culinary trade that are simply necessary in all kitchens, and a great non-stick pan is one of them! A non-stick pan versus a simple generic pan can make all the difference between the PERFECT omelette and a BURNT omelette. That is why you will love the new Tiabo Copper Frying Pan . Its Copper composition contains an amazing ceramic coating that is responsible for keeping your food from sticking! Nothing ever sticks to Tiabo pans--everything just slides right off! Best of all, the ceramic coating is made to last! It is dishwasher safe , and will not peel, rust, or corrode ! Featuring an ergonomic handle , this frying pan is easy to grip and makes cooking a joy! This pan is 100% Safe, as well as PFOA, PTFE & PFOS Free. It leaves food intact without the use of butter, lard, or oil! All kinds of foods glide off the slick coating of this pan with ease, so there's no need to add unnecessary fats and calories to your meals ! This pan evenly distributes heat so that everything you cook comes out perfectly! Tiabo frying pans can be used both on the stove top and inside of the oven! You can use this pan for frying, baking and cooking! No other generic brand out there has frying pans with so much versatility as a Tiabo pan! PAN FEATURES: • Non-Stick Technology • Copper Coating • Evenly Distributes Heat • No Oil or Butter Needed! •Works on StoveTop and in Oven • Dishwasher Safe • Measures 9.5 X 1.8 X 17 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710t4U5crLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiabo","source_asin":"B01K391Z8I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K391Z8I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K391Z8I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
