window.products.push({"id":202055,"name":"LAMEJOR Chevron Duvet Cover Set Queen Size Boho Style Geometric Design Reversible Luxury Soft Bedding Set Comforter Cover (1 Duvet Cover+2 Pillowcases","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917zY8bVr7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【WHAT YOU CAN GET】: It does NOT include the comforter. This is duvet COVER, it's a cover for comforter or duvet. You need to put your own duvet inside just like you put a pillow inside the pillowcase. 1 Queen duvet cover(90\"L x 90\"W), 2 pillowcases(30\"L x 20\"W). This Boho Style Chevron Geometric Striped Duvet Cover offers a luxuriously soft hand feel, and it also provides breathability, wrinkle-resistance. Duvet Cover has a zipper closure and ties to secure the insert. ✔【BOHO STYLE CHEVRON GEOMETRIC DECORATION】: Add a boho touch to the center of your suite with this geometric duvet set. Simple yet sophisticated, this boho style duvet cover set will update your bedroom. This Duvet Cover Set is reversible, both sides could be used individually, simply turn your duvet cover set over to change up your room decor anytime you want. ✔【PREMIUM FABRIC】: Our Duvet Cover Set is woven from the highest quality microfiber material, the feel of the fabric is like percale “cotton” (It is not cotton) and will continue to soften with each wash. Create a serene sleeping experience, leaving you feeling ultimate softness and comfort. Our Duvet Cover Sets are are Fade and Pilling Resistant. They will come out of the dryer looking fresh every time. And yes, they also are Wrinkle Resistant. ✔【EASY USE & CLEANING】: Each Geometric Duvet Cover complete with zipper closure, and it is easy to remove and wash. Also there are ties at each corner of the duvet cover, your comforter will stay in place nicely in the duvet cover. Machine washable in cold water and tumble dry on low. Fade, stain, shrink and wrinkle resistant. ✔【ULTIMATE GIFT IDEA】: If you are looking for something as a Christmas, New Year, Holidays, Birthday's gift to your mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter and all other beloved ones, this duvet cover set is a absolutely gorgeous choise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917zY8bVr7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAMEJOR","source_asin":"B0BYK92WYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYK92WYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYK92WYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
