window.products.push({"id":202141,"name":"Brandream Coastal Beach Bedding Set 100% Cotton Duvet Cover Set Reversible Zipper Closure 3-Piece King/Cal King(No Comforter Included)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818-HEVouoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER SOFT - COZY TOUCH - HIGH QUALITY 100% COTTON SUPER BREATHABLE AND COMFORTABLE. KING SIZE DUVET COVER 3PC Set - 1 duvet cover 92'' x 106'' with sturdy zipper closure, and 2 KING size pillow shams(Comforter insert needed not included) COASTAL BEDDING FOR ALL SEASONS - KEEP COASTAL AND FRESH - DESIGNER LUXURY LOOK - Soft silky material with Nautical THEME,cozy and STYLISH,add a fancy and comfortable feel,brighten up any bedroom,guest room,vacation home and a great gift choice. DURABLE QUALITY DEFINITELY LAST LONG. Machine-wash in cold gentle cycle. Dries quick on tumble dry low. Please keep zipper closed during washing. CUSTOM MADE style,please contact us if you have any other special needs for size request or matching pieces!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818-HEVouoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brandream","source_asin":"B09BJN69FG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BJN69FG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BJN69FG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":202142,"name":"aurrako Pull Down Spice Racks Organizer, 3-Tier Retractable Metal Spice Organizer for Cabinet, Pull Out Seasoning Organizer Spice Storage for Kitchen/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kYBFp6D3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❥ PULL-DOWN DESIGN：The retractable design stores kitchen essentials vertically, just open the cabinets and all spices are in view. This makes your spice shelf so much more organized! No more jars falling over or falling out of the cabinet. Makes cooking a joy! Overall size(Installation Completed): 15.75 x 8.08x 8.27inches / 40 x 20.5 x 21cm (LxWxH). Cabinet opening width at least: 14.76inches / 37.5cm. Available width of each layer: 2.36inches/6cm; Available length of each layer: 12.76inches/32.4cm. If your cabinet has doors, please reserve extra space for the door hinges. ❥ UTILIZE THE TOP CABINET - MAXIMIZE SPACE：Easy to use, saves valuable cabinet space. You can easily reach all of your spices without having to get the step ladder each time. Even if you are not tall enough, don’t worry anymore, the drop-down design can help you solve this problem well. This is a great way to utilize your top cabinet storage space. Great for helping you and your family be able to store spices on the top shelf of our cupboard and still be able to access them. ❥ 3-TIER MULTI-FUNCTION DESIGN：The stair-step levels arranges your items so they can all be seen easily. The compact design provides plenty of storage space. In the kitchen, it can storage your salt, pepper, cinnamon and various spices, herbs, curries, small jars, teas, coffees and baking supplies; Perfect for organizing medicines, vitamins, crafts, essential oils, etc; In the bathroom, you can store perfume, lotion, lipstick, nail polish, eye shadow and other supplies. ❥ STURDY STRUCTURE, EASY TO INSTALL：Note: Need to punch holes in the cabinet. The 3-tier spice rack made of by thicken metal, to make it more stability and durability. Easy-to-follow instructions and all hardware is included for quick, worry-free installation (Note: Please make sure to measure your cabinet accurately before installation.) Once installed they make accessing spices or whatever you put in them a breeze. Perfect gift for anyone who wants to organize their spices! ❥ 100% QUALITY ASSURANCE：5-YEAR WARRANTY, Aurrako branded use the high-quality metal materials and solid engineering so our products will last in tough environments like your home for years. Please feel free to contact us if you have any problems with our products, our customer support will solve it and make you satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kYBFp6D3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"aurrako","source_asin":"B0912W97B7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0912W97B7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0912W97B7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
