window.products.push({"id":202251,"name":"Levtex Home - Adeline Flowers - Rug/Carpet - 5 x 7 (60in. X 84in.) - Pink, Grey and Cream - 100% Polyester - Woven Fabric Backing - Bedroom, Playroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XTR4c7wtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LEVTEX HOME ADELINE RUG COLLECTION: The Adeline Flowers rug complements the Adeline bedding collection but can be used to accessorize any room in your home. The soft pile rug features a gorgeous farmhouse floral in sprays of pink and grey on a lush cream ground and will complement so many design choices. THE ADELINE DESIGN: One of our most popular collections, Adeline is inspired by natural bouquets picked in your country garden. The rug comes in many sizes, this 5 x 7 (60in. X 84in.) rug is the perfect size for small spaces, or an accent area in a large room. It is the perfect accessory for any bedroom, playroom, family room or kids' room. CONVENIENT LUXURY: Made from 100% Polyester, the Adeline rug is soft under foot. As with all rugs, we recommend using a rug pad, vacuuming regularly and rotating to keep use even. This is an indoor rug and should not be used in high moisture areas. COORDINATE YOUR HOME: Create a wonderful space with our Adeline Flowers Rug Collection. The design is versatile and will match a variety of different looks. You can also freshen your room with other items from the Levtex Home Collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XTR4c7wtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Levtex Home","source_asin":"B08XGL732S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XGL732S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XGL732S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
