window.products.push({"id":202271,"name":"Leffora Custom 1.5mm Thick Crystal Clear Table Cover Protector 36 x 92 Inch Waterproof PVC Protective Table Pad Transparent Mat for Coffee Table, Dini","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w3pDT-M4S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Updated Version CLEAR - New upgraded material and manufacturing processes, high transparency furniture top protector, is made of PVC material without BPA, o-benzene, and formaldehyde, great for families with kids or pregnant women. Protect your table, tablecloth and furniture tops against scratches, scuffs, stains, spillage, heating scalds; WIPEABLE, WATERPROOF and HEAT-RESISTANT - 1.5mm thickness heavy duty, heat resistance up to 160°F. Use as table runner or placemats top cover mat, to better protect your expensive wooden, glass, granite, marble, teak tables desks, or use as office computer or writing desk clear blotter pad, coffee bar or pub dining room table pad, cooktop, furniture tops liner; TIPS to MAKE IT FLATTEN - Our table protectors are packaged in rolls to ensure no creases. Here tips to make it flat after you received: 1. Heating dryer blow or expose table protector under sunshine in minutes; 2. Put heavy items pressing on the pad's reverse-roll direction in days; 3. Use accessory tape dots to fix table protector in place; 4. If need to trim it to fit, use pencil for trim line marks first，easy trim it with scissors or cutter knife; ABOUT AIR BUBBLES - Clear type table protector may have air bubbles on white smooth finish or smooth glass tabletop, please purchase the Frosted type table protector, or put tablecloth under table protector, to avoid visible air bubbles. Before put table protector on lacquered or polished NEW wooden tops, please ensure painted oils dry enough, or put tablecloth under table protector, to keep your new wooden tabletop's painted oil breathing; 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Every table protector from Leffora includes a Worry-Free guarantee to ensure your 100% satisfaction. If all above size listings are not suitable to you, we also offer special size customization services, please feel free to contact us if you have any questions or needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w3pDT-M4S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leffora","source_asin":"B09VKWPH7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VKWPH7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VKWPH7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":202272,"name":"SmartJars® Pegboard Organizer Accessories Storage Jars, Pegboard Jars for Garage Organization, Craft Room, or Pantry, Pegboard Bins with Lids, Pegboar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wyCubFzpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In three simple steps, items go from distributed clutter to organized and elegant: 1. You put your items in a SmartJar, 2. You snap the SmartJar Dock on to pegboard, 3. You put the SmartJar in to the Dock. Orderly. Easy to find. Laid out just the way you want. When stowed, the SmartJar gives you an easy view of whatever you decide to store in it. The docks are easily inserted and removed in a standard pegboard. SmartJars are transparent, air-tight, durable, and food-safe (BPA free.) Each SmartJar comes with a jar, lid and dock. The jar is a clear cylindrical container, 2½ inches in diameter and 4½ inches tall, with a clear, snap tight lid. They're just big enough for little hands to get in and will hold up to 1¼ cups (10 fluid oz.) The container is placed in the dock on its side so you can look through the lid to see what you have. You can also place a label on the lid for quick reference. On the pegboard, the dock takes up 3 inches by 3 inches and can be arranged directly adjacent to each other, either vertically or horizontally. The docks are currently available in black, blue, gray, red, white, and yellow. SmartJars are 100% Made in the USA. **Please Note Pegboard Compatibility: The SmartJar Dock is designed to snap easily and securely into standard pegboard measuring between 1/8\" to 3/16\" thick, with 1/4\" diameter holes on 1\" spacing. Standard pegboard is widely available on Amazon.com and other large retailers. This product is not compatible with thin, metal pegboard or pegboard panels with smaller holes like those offered by Crawford or Wall Control. Please visit SmartJars.com for our preferred list of compatible pegboards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wyCubFzpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmartJars","source_asin":"B00NI02JF8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NI02JF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NI02JF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
