window.products.push({"id":202354,"name":"Mark Feldstein History of Ford Trucks Model T - F150 Sound Wall Clock, 13 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ht6KgMOvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"History of Ford Trucks Sound On The Hour Wall Clock features twelve legendary Ford trucks from the origins through the present Clock is made of acrylic with slate grey finish; Requires 3 AA batteries (not included); Great collector's item for Ford enthusiasts Wall clock measures approximately 13.2 x 13.2 x 1.8 inches; Hear one of twelve authentic recordings of these classic trucks at the top of each hour Light sensor deactivates the songs when the room is dark to avoid nighttime disturbance and startling Packed within protective packaging","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ht6KgMOvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mark Feldstein & Associates","source_asin":"B071ZJS899","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071ZJS899","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071ZJS899","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
