window.products.push({"id":202431,"name":"Lorena’s Collection Faux Linen Sheer Curtain 63 Inch White Textured Voile Sheer Curtains Grommet Top Curtain Lightweight Floor Length Window Curtains ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n3IZMoZJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Curtain Specifications：2 panels of sheer curtains per package. Each panel is 54\" wide and 63\" long when hanging as a flat. The grommets are made of stainless with an inner diameter of 1.6 inches. Lightweight material：Unlike traditional curtains, sheer curtains are more comfortable due to their lightweight, especially in summer. Creating a warm and cozy atmosphere in your bedroom starts with curtains. If you want a space that is vibrant and active, this sheer curtain is the perfect choice to let in plenty of sunlight and keep your home sunny and well-ventilated. Multiple Occasions：Our sheer curtains can be taken advantage of within multiple areas at home, including a private bedroom, living room, and even at your working office. Stainless Grommet： Each panel integrates 8 stainless grommets suitable for most curtain rods on the market for hassle-free usage. Our hands are not readily being hurt by the grommets. Therefore, we can hang the curtains extremely smoothly. Care Instructions：After receiving the product, it can be ironed at a low temperature first, and the softness and hanging effect of the sheer curtain will be better after ironing.Do not use high-strength corrosive cleaning agents to clean, which will easily damage the original yarn material. Machine washable when needed, occasional care and cleaning for long-term use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n3IZMoZJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lorena’s Collection","source_asin":"B0BZY8XW9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZY8XW9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZY8XW9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
