window.products.push({"id":202629,"name":"Wood Cabbage Shredder - Slaw Board (Small)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ahzp8MG9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you serious about Sauerkraut? Then this is seriously the product for you. With three stainless steel blades and all wood construction, this wood cabbage shredder will cut the time it takes you to make sauerkraut or coleslaw in half! Unlike our Medium and Large Cabbage Shredders, the Small size shredder does not have a cabbage holder box.   The blades on this shredder are removable, but not adjustable. The blades on the Small size shredders are set at approximately 1/16\" apart, offering a finer shred than our Medium and Large Shredders. To shred cabbage, the shredder should be held at about 45 degrees.   The small size is perfect for those with a small kitchen. You will have to cut most heads of cabbage in half or fourths before shredding, but it's size is makes it easy to store.This is a natural unfinished wood product. This means it does not have a varnish or paint coating on top of the natural wood. However, it is sanded smooth and ready for use. Poplar is an ideal wood for kitchen utensils as it does not impart any taste or smell to food it comes in contact with. We recommend sealing the wood with a food safe oil before use. The oil from your hands, as well as the food will naturally darken the wood with use. This is normal, and not a concern. For washing, we suggest hand washing with mild soap and hot water to extend the life of your products. Let the product dry in a place with good air circulation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ahzp8MG9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stone Creek Trading","source_asin":"B06XGZL1M2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XGZL1M2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XGZL1M2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
