window.products.push({"id":202642,"name":"LuxAPP Sofa Slipcovers for 3 Seat Cushion Couch Slip Cover 3 Seat Couch Cover for 3 Cushion Couch Dog Couch Cover Protector Cover for Sofa 3 Seats 4 P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rlg3YL87L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"SUPERIOR MATERIAL: 85% polyester + 15% spandex with 240 GSM thickness knitted jacquard fabric makes our 4 piece couch covers for 3 seat cushion couch stretchy, comfortable, sturdy, safe, and skin-friendly, which is a great choice for a house full of kids, pets, dogs. Soft sofa cover that is so comfy to lay or sit on. PERFECT FIT: Our innovated 4 piece couch cover includes 1 piece of sofa slipcover, 3 pieces of the cushion cover. These super stretchy couch covers make it possible for most styles and sizes of the couch. This sofa slipcover fits sofa length 72-92 in, and each cushion covers 20-27.5 inch length, 19-25 inch width, 2-9 inch thickness. One size fits most. Please kindly refer to the measuring guide in the picture for more details before purchasing. FURNITURE PROTECTOR: Our stretchy couch covers will protect your sofa from the bottom to the top. Highly recommended for leather sofas and t cushion sofa 3 seat. They provide all-around protection, protecting your couch not only from stains, daily wear and tear, but also from dog hair and dander sticking. Furniture protector can also cover your old couch and revives it. The knitted jacquard design can change the whole look of your couch for a reasonable price. NON SLIP & EASY INSTALL: Our sofa slipcovers is especially designed for those sofas with separate cushions. Because the cushions are placed on the sofa, the slipcover will stay put after sitting or sleeping on it. Just slid it over the one end, put it around the back, and then continue putting it on over the arms, and then tuck extra fabric into the gap, and finally cover the cushions one by one. Please kindly refer to our picture guidelines or installation video. EASY CARE & WARRANTY: Machine Washable couch cover, wash at temperature below 30 Degrees Celsius. Please do not bleach, do not iron. Please wash it in the delicate cycle of your washer in cold water and tumble dry low (if you need to dry it). Mild laundry detergents are advised. We are confident in the quality of our sofa cover, and we would appreciate it if you could contact us for any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rlg3YL87L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LuxAPP","source_asin":"B089R5TZ7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089R5TZ7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089R5TZ7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":202643,"name":"Sggvecsy 30 Pcs 3 Styles Christmas Glitter Poinsettia Flowers Artificial Berry Picks Christmas Tree Ornaments Artificial Christmas Flowers with Clips ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AS8aLSlRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDED: Coming with 18 pieces Christmas glitter poinsettia flowers with 3 kinds of styles,12 pieces coated berry stems and 18 clips totally. Each poinsettia flower size various from approximately 5.2\" to 5.5’’ in diameter and each faux poinsettia flower is full of glitter powder, sparkly and gorgeous. PREMIUM MATERIAL: The artificial Christmas flowers decorations are made of high quality PVC and the surface is glitter powder, the artificial berry picks are made of high quality foam with a matte coating, which is eye-catching and beautiful. The fake poinsettia is lightweight but durable,the Xmas berry pick stem is made of iron wire, they can be slightly bent and operate according to your needs, flexible clips make them an effortlessly elegant and easy way to be used for multiple holiday decorating needs. EASY TO DECORATE：You can easily insert the clip tip into the root of the Christmas flowers then apply them on anywhere you prefer. The berry stems can be directly plug in the Xmas tree or other seasonal decor. They will lighting up your festival and remain beautiful,glittery through the whole holiday season. WIDELY APPLICATIONS: Suitable for Christmas Tree decoration, combined with ribbons, branches, vines, Christmas wreath, Christmas gift and other Christmas decorations. The Christmas tree ornaments also can be applied to holiday party wedding, birthday party, New Year or other festival decoration, elegant and stylish, helping to create joyful and warm atmosphere. ATTENTION: If there is some glitter dropping during transportation, it is a normal phenomenon, not quality problem, we suggested that open the box outdoor. Hope for your kindly understanding!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AS8aLSlRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sggvecsy","source_asin":"B0BCVMSK12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCVMSK12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCVMSK12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":202644,"name":"Christmas Engaged Ornaments 2022, Cool Engagement Gifts for Couples Newly Engaged Unique, Christmas Decoration for Newlyweds Married Couple, Two-Side ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u0lWClDsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👩‍❤‍👨2022 Engagement Ornament - The Christmas tree is like a family tree, and the decorations on it are like every family member. Being engaged means that you have become a family member. The engagement decorations are commemorative and record your happy moments. wish you a happy engagement! 🎄Christmas Decorations - Christmas engagement ornaments trusted by 30 million people have always been popular with the public. Our design is permanently pressed directly on the Christmas decorations. This is the perfect gift. The Christmas decorations hanging with your lover every year will become an unforgettable memory in the future. Get ready for the coming Christmas. Merry Christmas to you in advance! 👩‍❤‍👨Cool Engagement Gifts for Couples - This beautiful ornament is an excellent souvenir gift for newlyweds, as well as a regular gift for newlyweds or bridal parties/engagement parties.It can be used to decorate Christmas trees, Christmas gifts, Christmas garlands or interior decorations. In addition, it can be accompanied by a small card on which you can write Merry Christmas, Happy Engagement and Happy New Year. 🎄Easy to Hang - If you get them, you'll like them. The engaged ornament is a large decoration with very good size (3 inches) and moderate thickness. It is light (1.08 ounces) and will not overwhelm branches. Pre drilled hole. High quality ceramic surface is durable image, double-sided printing.It is easy to add to every Christmas tree. 💖Service & 2 Yearss Warranty - Package includes 1 * 2022 engagement Christmas ornament, 1 * gold ribbon and 1 * box. We provide 2 years of free replacement service and 7 * 24 hours of customer service. If you receive defective products, please contact us and we will immediately send you replacement parts free of charg.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u0lWClDsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BERCOL","source_asin":"B08J9QXH8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J9QXH8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J9QXH8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":202645,"name":"Heating Pad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Are you tired of those cheaply made heating pads for these things? - Not hot enough to relieve your pain - Poor plastic type, feel rough and uncomfortable - Fear of dozing off and forgetting to shut it before you fell asleep Forget those old & weak designs, our All New Improved Heating Pads are GUARANTEED to be markedly stronger than any of the others. Now let's make a comparison: Heating Wire: Double-Layer Heating Wire VS Single Heating Wire Chamubeauty heating pad adopts double-layer heating wire is fast heating and flexible, distributing more of an even heat and all over penetrating warmth without 'hot' or 'cold' spots. Material: Soft Flannel & Premium Cotton VS Hard Plastic Material The electric heating pad is made of incredibly soft flannel and premium cotton that is used in the most luxurious and comfy winter pajamas for awesome cozy feeling. Function: 90Min Auto Off VS Nothing 90min auto off helps you avoid the subconscious anxiety before you fell asleep, 3 different temperatures will give you the option of applying a mild heat or stronger depending on your needs. Customer service is always ready for you: Click the store name “Chamubeauty” -- Ask a question -- An order I placed Choose the right order number and tell us your concern, we will absolutely reply you within 1 business day! Specifications: Voltage: 120v 60Hz Size: 24*12 inches Power Cable: 90 inches WARNING! 1. Do not let pets bite or scratch it. 2. Do not fold the heating pad to avoid damaging the wire. 3. Please put it on your body instead of underneath, the heat may increase when the pad stays close to the body. 4. If the item is overheating or there is burnt smell during use, please unplug it immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duomishu","source_asin":"B08CZ9CGVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZ9CGVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZ9CGVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
