window.products.push({"id":202665,"name":"Lemon Zester Grater, Ourokhome Manual Stainless Steel Hard Cheese Grater for Chocolate, Ginger, Coconut, Citrus, Nutmeg, Lime, Fruit, Vegetable with C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7179220692L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"◑ A Lemon Zester with a Very Comfortable Handle: Unlike the handles of lemon grinders on the market, our handles are curved, when you hold the handle, your palm will fit firmly into the handle, which will relieve stress on your hands and keep your joint healthy. The Parmesan cheese grater with a hanging hole so can be hung it on the wall to save your kitchen space. Ourokhome have always gone to great lengths to provide convenience tools for customers. ◑ A Kitchen Zester That Will Improve Your Cooking Immediately: Good-looking food tends to whet people's appetite, with our zester grater, you can get a bunch of fluffy cheddar cheese in seconds and enjoy a fine pile of cheese that melts almost instantly on your hot pasta. You can enjoy a coffee topped with fluffy chocolate flakes, feast a salad witch fresh lemon crumbs in an instant, make lemon marmalade at home just like mom. You will surely become that popular chef in your family. ◑ A Ginger Grater That Will Save You a Lot of Precious Time: We use the thick 304 stainless steel imported from Germany as the blade, which will never get rust, deform and obtuse. The teeth of blade are arranged at random, which increases the contact area between blade and ingredients. In addition, the blade is longer than the general style on the market ( The size is: 8.86 inches length and 1.57 inches width) It can greatly reduce the valuable time you spend in preparing food. ◑ A Grinder That Can Handle a Lot of Ingredients: It's a good helper in your kitchen, ideal for citrus, vegetable, fruit, nutmeg, cheese (soft and hard), lemon, lime, orange, grapefruit, ginger, garlic, carrot, chocolate, coconut, etc. It is not just for your kitchen, it’s also good for your RV, camping, BBQ and so on. Easy clean: Cleaning is no longer a boring thing as we provide specialized cleaning brush, most importantly, the hand grater is top rack dishwasher safe. ◑ Perfect gift: This hand lime zester will be a sweet gift for your family and friends, we have designed a beautiful package that is perfect for giving gifts. It will make their cooking easier, improves their grating efficiency and improves their cooking in seconds. ◑ Risk-free purchase: We value our customers and hope you will enjoy a pleasant shopping experience, so we offer 365 days free warranty without any question asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7179220692L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ourokhome","source_asin":"B0BCVS8YTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCVS8YTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCVS8YTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
