window.products.push({"id":202749,"name":"Empire State Building and New Yorker - New York City Photo Souvenir Refrigerator Magnet NYC Fridge Metal Magnet - New York Landmarks Cool Collectible ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81llra0MKtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let's hear it for New York... the city so awesome they named it twice - \"New York, New York!\". A city that is never sleeping is captured in incredibly artistic photographs on these quality NYC magnets from NY Poster “New York City Landmarks” collection. From Brooklyn Bridge to Lady Liberty, Central Park to Midtown Manhattan, Times Square to Little Italy - all the most famous landmarks and sites are represented in glorious shots taken by Igor Maloratsky. Igor Maloratskiy is a local, well-known photo artist and his portraits of the NY cityscapes featured on Art Prints, Cards, and Souvenir Magnets. Hi was capturing New York landmarks and impressions of this incredible city for the last 25 years and best shots from his art collection now featured on NYC Magnets. Any Photo Magnet from our NY Gifts Collection will make a classy corporate gift, stylish souvenir, and cool keepsake. Furthermore, our magnets are also an easy way to tap into the trend of NYC-inspired home décor. Your purchase is covered by the Amazon Guarantee and our no-questions-asked returns policy. Add your favorite photo magnet featuring famous New York City Landmark to your cart now for an instant New York state of mind!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81llra0MKtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NY Poster Inc","source_asin":"B00BXKNCS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BXKNCS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BXKNCS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":202750,"name":"TUBBZ Street Fighter Ryu Collectible Rubber Duck Figurine – Official Street Fighter Merchandise – Unique Limited Edition Collectors Vinyl Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LvXLKR8VL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"OFFICIAL STREET FIGHTER MERCH: Kick, punch, and hadouken your current collectables away – there’s a new fighter in town, with TUBBZ, the collectable cosplaying duck figurines! The Street Fighter wave sets the scene with Ryu, one of gaming’s most iconic fighting characters. Coming boxed in an awesome displayable ‘Street Fighter’ tub display stand, this one of a kind collectable is great for fans of the series to stock up on! MAKES A GREAT GIFT: An excellent gift for the mini cosplayer in your life, this TUBBZ series of collectibles is sure to be an excellent gift option for the gamer in your life. With so many more figurines to collect, this gift is the gift that keeps on giving, and is guaranteed to please your game-loving friend, family member or loved one. COLLECT THEM ALL: Begin your collection right here and now! Collect all of the collectible characters from your favourite video games, movies, TV shows, and comic books as they come vibrantly to life as collectible cosplaying rubber ducks. TUBBZ COLLECTABLE: Tubbz are fun collectibles that have transformed all of your favourite characters into duck-style figurines. The Cosplaying Rubber Duck Collectible comes in a collector’s bathtub display box, while the TUBBZ Duck itself is crafted using durable, high-quality PVC. Measuring 9 cm (3.54’’) tall when outside of its tub display stand. 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: We at TUBBZ are as passionate as we are confident about the quality of our TUBBZ Collectable Duck Figures. We take a lot of care to ensure that we leave you a satisfied customer every step of the way, which is why each purchase comes with a 1-year manufacturer's warranty. So, if at any point you are not happy with our product, contact us so that we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LvXLKR8VL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUBBZ","source_asin":"B09DK2K44F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DK2K44F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DK2K44F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
