window.products.push({"id":202829,"name":"Costilo Milk Frother Handheld for Coffee, Electric Milk Frother Foam Maker Battery Operated Whisk Drink Mixer, Stainless Steel Mini Foamer for Coffee,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lJnQDzVQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Be your own brista & surprise your loved ones with frothy drinks every day with the Costilo electric handheld milk frother, From Cappuccinos, Lattes, Macchiatos, Matcha, Protein shakes, Milk Shakes, eggs to all your favorite sauces. Turn yourself into a barista with this milk frother. Usage Notice: The wand froths hot or cold milk in under 60 seconds, and works best on whole milk (as is the case for most frothers). It takes two AA batteries to kick into gear, and they're not included. Despite the 19,000 RPMs the frother is also very quiet, which is handy for households with sleeping children or spouses working from home in the next room. Overall, we are the best choice ！ Fully Soak the whisk into milk, press the ON/OFF switch, the whisk will start to run and make foam. As soon as the milk froth starts forming, lift the appliance slightly so that it always in the froth layer. When the milk is frothy enough,press the switch once more to stop the whisk running. Please remember to keep your frother OFF before lifting the whisk out of the milk to avoid spraying the liquid everywhere. If you would like to make hot milk froth, the temperature of the milk should not be over 60℃/140℉, otherwise, the milk will not froth up perfectly. Ideal Gift for Coffee Lover Handheld milk frother for coffee, drink mixer, lightweight & portable Creates delicate foam for lattes, matcha, cappuccinos, hot chocolates and more Stainless steel whisk, safe and easy to clean Powered by 2 AA batteries (NOT included) Material : Stainless Steel & ABS Package Size ：71 * 71 * 235 Note: 1. AA Batteries not included 2. Be careful to keep the plastic top with the batteries out of the water Package Includes: 1 x Milk Frother (batteries not included） 1 x Instruction Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lJnQDzVQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Costilo","source_asin":"B09Y1PKGF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1PKGF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1PKGF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
