window.products.push({"id":202833,"name":"Hashcart Small Jewelry Box - Decorative Wooden Keepsake Box - Trinket Box - Handmade Brass Inlayed Box for Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q8jftBKcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"When you first glance at this hand crafted jewelry box you see a gorgeous piece of art. Designer wood handcrafted boxes are designed especially to complete the feminine desires to preserve the valuable jewelry & fragile items from moisture. This is a sleek and simple trinket jewelery case for everyday use. Keep your small jewelry items like earrings, rings, toe rings safe and secure in this box. Also a multi utility box can be used to preserve precious items. Our handmade jewelry boxes make gifts for women and girls that can be treasured for a lifetime. On the lid of the Handmade Indian Wood Jewelry Box is a beautiful motif produced out of inlaid brass. The technique is called tarkashi and involves carefully hammering pieces of genuine brass into engravings in the wood. The careful attention to detail makes the more than just a place for storing earrings, bracelets, rings, necklaces and even coins. The piece doubles as a decorative item that can be displayed anywhere in the home. Thanks to the ideal size of our fine jewelry container, you can always pack it with you wherever you go and look stunning no matter where you are. Pack it in any bag or backpack and you can enjoy being a stunner on the go! Our antique jewelry holder is simply created to put smiles on women's faces. If you're looking for the perfect Anniversary | Valentine's Day gift for your significant other half, or for a beautifully crafted jewelry case for your little girl. When you want to make simple and symbolic gifts to your friends and family, this trinket box may be just the right gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q8jftBKcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hashcart","source_asin":"B01MRKU4M7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRKU4M7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRKU4M7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
