window.products.push({"id":202963,"name":"White Wooden Serving Tray with Handles, 12\"x12\"x2\"H Square Countertop Organizer Tray， Decorative Cosmetics Tray for Kitchen, Bathroom, Sturdy Food Tra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gfIqcZywL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile White Wood Tray - Used as bathroom tray, vanity tray, decorative tray, perfume tray, entryway tray, bedside table tray, coffee table tray and more. Set it on the toilet tank top, vanity, dresser, nightstand, end table, desk or kitchen counter in your house, to cut the countertop clutter, keep all your favorite items organized and within easy reach. In addition, it can be used as a white serving tray in cafes, restaurants and bars. Designed for serving, organizing and decor display - This white tray can use to to serve food and beverages, or keep small things stored and properly organized so that you can easily reach them when you need them. Perfect for storing any small items such as soap dispensers, soap dishes, toothbrush holders, hand towels, toiletries, cosmetics, candles, perfumes, jewelry, office supplies, crafting supplies, collectibles and more. White Tray Compliments Any Decor - White tray adds a classy finish to any decor, a raised rim keeps items safely and neatly on the tray, two cut-out handles offer easy mobility, while the under pads protects your surfaces from scratches, offering you easy access to your favorite projects. Fits for any style bathroom, bedroom, living room or kitchen, you can use this square tray for decoration in just about any place of the house. Sturdy Construction - Constructed from manufactured wood, with a sleek white finish, this white vanity tray is practical, expressive, and aesthetic all at once, making it the perfect addition to your home decor. Instantly use this white jewelry holder tray, makeup tray to showcase your beauty must haves: cosmetics, lipsticks, foundations, eye shadows, perfumes! Gently wiple clean with a soft, dry cloth to remain elegant looks. Great Gift Idea & After Sales Support - Whether you're serving drinks and snacks or just keeping your cosmetics organized on your dresser, this white decorative tray is here to add a little style to your space. It is also an ideal gift on Christmas, birthday, housewarming, wedding, or any other special holiday. After-sales support services available, let us know if you have any questions about our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gfIqcZywL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Satu Brown","source_asin":"B09M67M1C8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M67M1C8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M67M1C8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":202964,"name":"CORRURE 'Birthday Queen' Sash Glitter with Metallic White Foil - Black Glitter Birthday Sash for Women - Happy Birthday Sash for Girls, Sweet 16, 18th","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DRbXFPxhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️ QUEEN OF THE PARTY – This elegant birthday sash will make you stand out and turn heads wherever you are. Dress up and enjoy being the center of attention on your special day. ✅ SPARKLE LIKE NO OTHER -- With this uniquely designed sash with 'Birthday Queen' message you will feel beautiful and confident knowing no other girl in the room will have your kind of sash. Wear it with flair whatever your style is! ✅ FITS PERFECTLY -- Dimension: 33.5 x 3.7 inches. Will fit most women or men. The soft and smooth satin material makes it extremely comfortable to wear even for a long time. Ready to wear and looks good on any outfit! ✅ PARTY ALL DAY AND NIGHT -- Elegant, stylish, and made of premium quality black glitter sash with white foil lettering. Unlike other poorly made sashes, this birthday sash does not tear or wrinkle easily. No need to worry about letters peeling off. It can withstand all the fun craziness you and your friends are up to. Durable and reusable for the following years. ✅ AWESOME CELEBRATION, PERFECT GIFT -- Enjoy a memorable birthday with this trendy sash. You can upgrade your Sweet 16 Party, 18th Birthday Party, 21st Celebration, Dirty 30th Birthday or any other birthday parties. Also makes a thoughtful present for a beloved family or friend. ✅ RESISTANT TO WILD PARTIES -- Don't worry if you like to party hard, this black ribbon sash will be there all along the way. It already comes with pins so just take it out of the package and wear it. Great for anybody who wants a wonderful bday party ✅ CORRURE 100% HAPPY GOAL -- Our goal is to make all our customers enjoy the beautiful happy moments in life. We made thousands of customers happy so far but, if for any reason, you are not satisfied, get in touch with us and we promise to make it better or give you 100% refund. Press the \"Add to Cart\" button now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DRbXFPxhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CORRURE","source_asin":"B0835RCZXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-202964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0835RCZXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0835RCZXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
